            <ArticleTitle>Stress echocardiography vs nuclear stress imaging in clinical cardiology.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>324-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Stress echocardiography and nuclear stress imaging are important non-invasive tools in clinical cardiology. This review discusses the uses, strengths and limitations of these imaging modalities and looks at whether stress echocardiography can actually replace nuclear stress imaging.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
